{"title":"Cuddle Club - platonic body nourishing.","startsAt":"2026-10-16T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-16T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**CUDDLE CLUB.**\n**Have you tried that?**\n\n**In Amsterdam cuddle events are sold out quickly. Even few different Cuddle clubs are happening at the same day. It's so popular there.**\n\n**In Toronto there** **is** **nearly no Cuddle clubs yet.**\n**But we are doing that.**\n**Join our tantric group and leave a message in comments if you wanna join the waiting list.**\n**T.me/TorontoTantra**\n**___**\n**About this event**\n**• What is the cuddle club?**\n\n**It’s a cozy evening to experience how deeply nourishing it can feel to be held, without any romantic or sexual expectations. A space where people can come together to share love and touch. We cuddle platonically, the way you’d hold a child or a kitten.**\n\n**• What will we be doing?**\n\n**Facilitator will guide you through some gentle exercises to help you unwind after your day, soften into your body, and calm your nervous system. We aim to make you feel safe in your own body, which can help you connect with others.**\n\n**• Cuddle puddle perfection**\n\n**Everything is by invitation, but we will guide you into a beautifully structured cuddle puddle. It is a very comfortable, welcoming way of cuddling where you are held and touched by multiple people at the same time. Chances are you’ll float home afterwards, high on oxytocin.**\n\n**• Important terms & agreements:**\n1. **Keep it platonic: we cuddle without romantic or sexual expectations or escalations**\n1. **Take care of yourself and others: communicate and respect boundaries**\n1. **Be here fully: This is a sober space. No drugs, no alcohol. No phones.**\n\n**Details in telegram group:**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**\n\n**TICKETS**\n**Regular Ticket — $50 CAD**\n**Early Bird Ticket — $35 CAD (If you register and pay before August 31).**\n**Supportive Ticket — $25 CAD (For students and people with low financial income).**\n**Combo — $60 CAD for 2 people (Bring a friend).**\n\n**Free participation.**\n**We want everyone to have an opportunity to participate. If the price is too much for you, send a personal message on Telegram: t.me/AndyTherapist to ask about volunteer options.**\n\n**If you have any questions, feel free to message:**\n**t.me/AndyTherapist**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"T.me/TorontoTantra Circle","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/e/8/f/highres_535612879.jpeg"}